<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/Sbom> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Bom> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/LifecycleScopeType/decommission> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A relationship has specific context implications for a product's retirement and/or decommissioning."@en .
